    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Rosemary Wanjiru Wangai, a seasoned communications professional, is taking her career to new heights by pursuing a Master's in Strategic Communications at Aga Khan University's Graduate School for Media and Communications (GSMC). With over six years of experience in the field, Rosemary has honed her skills in crafting compelling narratives and developing effective communication strategies.",
